Documentation on script "create_maestro"

-----------------------
For those who have uploaded GEM via the SSM package:
Use create_maestro to create your suite.

Example:

create_maestro -location [mysuite_name] -cfg $GEM_DIR/configurations/GEM_cfgs

(default configuration is $GEM_DIR/configurations/GEM_cfgs)

-----------------------

For those who have uploaded GEM via the GoaS method for using your own binaries,
scripts, etc.:

You must be in your $GEM_GIT_DIR/work-* directory to use the script "create_maestro"

Here are 3 examples in creating maestro suites
a) create_maestro (uses GEM_cfgs configuration)
   creates maestro suite in
   $HOME/.suites/goas/$GEM_version/${GEM_GIT_DIR}/GEM_cfgs/work-*
b) create_maestro -exp [configurations/GEM_cfgs_GY_FISL_H] for example
   creates maestro suite in
   $HOME/.suites/goas/$GEM_version/${GEM_GIT_DIR}/GEM_cfgs_GY_FISL_H/work-*
c) create_maestro -location TATA
   creates maestro suite using GEM_cfgs in
   $HOME/.suites/TATA

A link for each suite is made under ${GEM_GIT_DIR}/work-*/suites/[name_of_suite]
for each maestro suite created.
